==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|tíu|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{m|gem-pro|*tehun||ten}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|is}} {{m|ine-pro|*déḱm̥t||ten}}. Cognate with Faroese ''[[tíggju]]'', Swedish {{term|tio|lang=sv}}, Danish {{term|ti|lang=da}} and English ''[[ten]]''.

===Numeral===
'''tíu''' 

# '''[[ten]]'''; the cardinal number after [[níu#Icelandic|níu]] and before [[ellefu#Icelandic|ellefu]].

